# Doom II MAP30 (T10.6): started beside line 40 (special 140, tag 2), on its
# front, the player uses it, then waits for the movers it set going
# (at most 450 tics). Written by tools/RouteGen (map30-line40).
iwad doom2
map MAP30
start 2880 -416 270

# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
0 0 0 0
0 0 0 2
0 0 0 0 x461
